FaultBraid instrumented etcd/raft source patch

This directory contains a minimal source patch for etcd/raft v3.7.0.
The upstream project is https://github.com/etcd-io/raft at tag v3.7.0,
commit b867cf13f6bc0dae21204302df97bc2355c3af55.

The patch adds Config.ElectionRandom and upstream tests for deterministic,
per-instance election timeout selection. Modified files carry a FaultBraid
instrumentation notice in the added API documentation. The prepared upstream
source is generated under .local-runs and is not committed.

